+### A number beside the advice and a check of a loan offer, 30 Oct 2026 (branch `feat/advice-and-offer`)
+
+Two of the four candidates the owner was offered on 30 Oct 2026; they chose the first and the third, called candidate 1 and candidate 3 below (these are not rows of the owner's feature table, which is numbered differently). They were built in their own worktree (`.claude/worktrees/advice-and-offer`) so that other chats could go on working in the root folder, and **they were not integrated when this entry was written**: nothing was merged until the owner asked, which they did on 31 Oct 2026 (the entry after this one). The first prints a figure under the pieces of advice that have one (`advisory.amounts`). The third is a card on `/advisory` where the reader types in a loan offer they were made and sees what it costs. Neither adds a request field, so `SENT_FIELDS`, the notice, its hash and the payload code are unchanged. On the branch alone the suite was 2,209 tests in 59 files and the dictionaries 941 keys (7,528 values); the entry after this one has the counts after the replay.
